
mint form
  case name
    slot name
  case head, mint head
    slot head
  case link, mint link
    slot link
  case bond, mint bond
    slot bond
  case rein
    slot rein
  case task, mint task
    slot task
  hook make
    make form
      bind name, read name
      bind head, read head
      bind link, read link
      bind bond, read bond
      bind rein, read rein
      bind task, read task

mint bond
  case name
    slot name
  case line
    slot line
  case call, mint call
    slot call
  hook make
    make bond
      bind name, read name
      bind line, read line
      bind call, read call
